    description: "Found by the 2026-11-24 docstring staleness audit (dev 7e204b35b): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_11242026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. _ImportCollector builds names with '.'.join(self._scope) (import_closure.py:170-171), with no #N suffix; block_hash names a second same-named def f#2 (block_hash.py:246-247). Two `def f` under if/else, the second doing `import p.other`: build(..., at_import={path: ['f#2']}) gives frozenset(); ['f'] counts the imports of both defs. r33, v11."  # 00fc
